											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "Save the current value in a temporary, set the new one, call `super`, then restore the saved value. Each nested call keeps its own saved value, so this works like a stack without an explicit stack object. That's how `currentContainer` and `currentMethod` work in {{gtClass:GtSmaCCKotlinClassPartsImporter}}."
									},
									{
